%N A401791 a(n) = 1 if n is 1, a prime or n is not squarefree, otherwise 0.
%H A401791 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A401791/b401791.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..65537</a>
%H A401791 Michael De Vlieger, <a href="/A401791/a401791.png">Plot a(n) at (x,y) = (n mod 900,-floor(n/900))</a>, for n = 1..810000.
%H A401791 <a href="/index/Ch#char_fns">Index entries for characteristic functions</a>.
%H A401791 <a href="/index/Eu#epf">Index entries for sequences computed from exponents in factorization of n</a>.
%F A401791 a(n) = A063524(n) + A010051(n) + A107078(n)
%F A401791 For n > 1, a(n) = abs(A106743(n)) = 1-A354819(n).
%t A401791 {1}~Join~Array[Boole[Or[PrimeQ[#], ! SquareFreeQ[#]]] &, 104, 2] (* _Michael De Vlieger_, Nov 08 2026 *)
%t A401791 (* Alternative: load 810000 terms from the image in Links: *)
%t A401791 Floor /@ Flatten@ ImageData@ Import["https://oeis.org/A401791/a401791.png", "Image"] (* _Michael De Vlieger_, Nov 08 2026 *)
%o A401791 (PARI) A401791(k) = ((1==k) || isprime(k) || !issquarefree(k));
%Y A401791 Characteristic function of A363597, union of powers of primes (A000961) and numbers that are not squarefree (A013929).
%Y A401791 Absolute values of A106743.
%Y A401791 Cf. A003986, A010051, A063524, A107078, A354819.
%K A401791 nonn,easy,new
%O A401791 1
